Today, I finally ascended to demigodhood for the first time.

Block-W ascended with 4 942 048 points after 69427 moves.

Some of the following might be considered spoilers...




















It took me five days to do this. And I played about 5 to 6 hours each
day (except the last two).

First day: 
My wizard started with rings of teleport and teleport conrol. What a luck.
Went to the bottom of Gnomish Mines. Didn't find the luckstone. (I
didn't have the patience to look for it too hard.) So: have a scroll of
magic mapping with you when entering the lowest level of mines.
Back up and to the quest. I was level 12 when getting the call from
Wizzard of Balance so I needed to get  60 000 exp.points more. I fought
those points and after that I killed three wraiths so I was level 17
when starting the quest. The quest was easy. I traveled down to Medusa
level and saved my game.

Second day:
Getting over the sea was a bit tricky. Wand of cold got me halfway and
then I had to dig my way to the next level. I went up the stairs totally
forgetting that the medusa was standing by the stairway. My speedboots
saved my life. Wrapped a towel around my head and chopped the Medusa
with Vorpal Blade. (A wish from a djinni.) Oh yes, had only two
artifacts in the game: Vorpy, and Magicbane from a sacrifice. Hacked
through castle. Found a ring of levitation. (By this I had both Telep.
and Telep.Cont. as intrinsics.) Wished for GDSM and ShOR and AOLS.
And something other. Went to Gehennom and started looking for Vlad.

Third day:
Didn't find Vlad until some kind soul pointed to me how to find him.
In hell find two upstairs on same level and there he is. Killing Wiz was
easy. And then downwards. I had already located the place where earth
vibrated and performed the ritual. Down I went and killed the High
Priest of Moloch and grabbed the Amulet of Yendor. Went up about ten
levels and got this idea. I invoked the Eye of Aethiopica and opened a
Magic Portal to Gnomish Mines. Stupid, stupid and stupid. I got there,
but the amulet did not. Back to the Wiz by level teleport and Magic
portal. KIlled him and grabbed the amulet back. Then up. It was hard.
Entered endgame. Didn't find the portal. Used up two amulets of life
saving with those Earth elementals and the reappearing Wiz. Saved.

Fourth day:
Finally found the portal to air level. There the portal was easy to
find. The fire level almost got me to quit. I spent more than 5 thousand
turns on the fire level looking for the portal. There I also died to a
Runtime error R6003. Luckily I had backupped my save file. Continued
searching without luck. Saved.

Fifht day:
Found the portal. Also the Water level portal was easy to find. On
astral plane I teleported to the approximate location of a temple and
behold the first on was mine. Offered the amulet and ascended. Huh!

I still think that the endgame is frustrating. But overall this game is
simply magnificent. Thank you dev. team. 

